<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>首页 - 新家</title>
    <style>
        /* 基础重置 */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
        }

        body, html {
            height: 100%;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* 主卡片容器，模拟图2的圆角边框 */
        .main-container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 900px;
            height: 85vh;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 30px;
            padding: 30px;
            position: relative;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        /* 顶部图片区域（浅灰色背景 + 头像） */
        .hero-section {
            width: 100%;
            height: 55%;
            background-image: url('beijintu.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            position: relative;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* 名字区域：镂空白色效果 */
        .name-box {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 20px;
            right: 35%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
        }

        .no-text {
            font-size: 100px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: transparent; /* 文字透明 */
            -webkit-text-stroke: 2px white; /* 白色描边实现镂空感 */
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-right: 10px;
        }

        .name-text {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: transparent;
            -webkit-text-stroke: 1px white;
        }

        /* 圆形头像 */
        .avatar-circle {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -50px;
            right: 5%;
            width: 180px;
            height: 180px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-image: url('xiaomao.jpg');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            background-color: #808080; /* 如果图片没加载出来的备用色 */
            border: 4px solid #ffffff; /* 加上白边让它更突出 */
            z-index: 10;
        }

        /* 下半部分文本内容 */
        .info-section {
            flex-grow: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: flex-end;
            padding-top: 50px; /* 给头像留出空间 */
        }

        .quote-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #000000;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .personal-info {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666666; /* 深灰 */
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .tags-container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .tag {
            font-size: 18px; /* 比正文大，比NO小 */
            color: #000000;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .signature-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #999999; /* 浅灰 */
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        /* 分割线 */
        .divider {
            width: 100%;
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #e0e0e0;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        /* 底部按钮区域 */
        .footer-action {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .next-btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #000000;
            font-size: 18px;
            padding: 10px 30px;
            border: 2px solid #000000;
            border-radius: 12px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .next-btn:hover {
            background-color: #000000;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* 移动端适配 */
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .no-text { font-size: 60px; }
            .name-text { font-size: 16px; }
            .avatar-circle { width: 100px; height: 100px; bottom: -20px; }
            .hero-section { height: 45%; }
            .main-container { height: 90vh; padding: 20px; }
            .name-box { right: 25%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="main-container">
        <!-- 顶部背景和头像 -->
        <div class="hero-section">
            <div class="name-box">
                <span class="no-text">No</span>
                <span class="name-text">(Name)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="avatar-circle"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- 底部信息与按钮 -->
        <div class="info-section">
            <p class="quote-text">人没有两颗心脏 所以爱恨同源 悲欢共振</p >
            
            <p class="personal-info">女 ISTP le 23</p >
            
            <div class="tags-container">
                <span class="tag">#三无</span>
                <span class="tag">#病恋</span>
                <span class="tag">#普陪</span>
                <span class="tag">#树洞</span>
            </div>
            
            <p class="signature-text">我们不是片刻的恋人了</p >
            
            <div class="divider"></div>
            
            <div class="footer-action">
                <!-- 这里的 href 对应下一页的文件名 -->
                <a href=" " class="next-btn">下一页</a >
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
